{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue Scum is a sci-fi action-roguelike survivors game with dialogs. Survive wave after wave of enemies until you face the final boss.  Create different builds during each run by selecting different level-up rewards from a wide range of weapons and equipment.\u00a0Gather minerals in each run and bring them to your base of operations to buy new weapons and upgrades and help yourself in the next run.<br> Player weapons aim and fire automatically.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">-= Rogue Scum Features =-</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Huge hordes of enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Awesome weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unlimited upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Base of operations on a spaceship Big Fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Lots of fun tasks to finish (achievements)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Cool characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Play as Operator - an independent agent operating on the fringes of known space, looking to make profit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ hours of gameplay to unlock everything (depending on player skill and luck).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3660900?t=1744789042","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3660900?t=1744789042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660900/0cf14c3db2497ec283704f361144b5119a040972/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744789042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660900/0cf14c3db2497ec283704f361144b5119a040972/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744789042","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue Scum is 